  m_text: "<i><size=150%>Core Creative & Leadership  </size>  </i>\r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Game
    Directors:</size>  </i> Brian Pearson , Alexandre Nazario , Michael Lamm, Aaron
    Marmion ,  Ignacio Aponte\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Technical Director:</size>  </i> 
    Brian Pearson\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Art Director: </size>  </i>Michael Lamm\r\n\r\n<i><size=150%>Design
    Team</size>  </i>\r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Game Designers:</size>  </i> Alexandre
    Nazario , Aaron Marmion , Brian Pearson , Michael Lamm , Ignacio Aponte\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Level
    Designers:</size>  </i> Alexandre Nazario\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Narrative Designer
    / Writer:</size>  </i> Michael Lamm\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Systems Designer: </size> 
    </i>\nAlexandre Nazario , Aaron Marmion \r\n\n<i><size=120%>UI/UX Designer: </size> 
    </i>Michael Lamm , Ignacio Aponte\r\n\n<i><size=120%>Combat Designer: </size> 
    </i>Aaron Marmion , Brian Pearson \r\n\r\n<i><size=150%>Engineering & Programming</size> 
    </i>\r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Gameplay Programmers:</size>  </i>  Alexandre Nazario
    , Aaron Marmion , Brian Pearson , Michael Lamm \n\r\n<i><size=120%>AI Programmer:</size> 
    </i> Brian Pearson\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Tools / Build Engineer: </size>  </i>Brian
    Pearson\r\n\r\n<i><size=150%>Art & Animation</size>  </i>\r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Concept
    Artists: </size>  </i>Michael Lamm \n\r\n<i><size=120%>3D Character Artists:
    </size>  </i>Alexandre Nazario , Michael Lamm\n \r\n<i><size=120%>Environment
    / Asset Artists:</size>  </i>  Aaron Marmion ,  Michael Lamm \n\r\n<i><size=120%>Lead
    Animator:</size>  </i> Alexandre Nazario\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Technical Artist:</size> 
    </i>  Aaron Marmion , Michael Lamm \n\r\n<i><size=120%>VFX / Lighting Artist:
    </size>  </i>Aaron Marmion , Brian Pearson\r\n\r\n<i><size=150%>Audio & Sound</size> 
    </i>\r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Audio Director:</size>  </i> Ignacio Aponte\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Sound
    Designers: </size>  </i>Ignacio Aponte , Brian Pearson\r\n\r\n<i><size=150%>Production
    & Quality Assurance</size>  </i>\r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Project Manager:</size> 
    </i> Brian  Pearson\n\r\n<i><size=120%>QA Testers: </size>  </i>Brian Pearson
    , Alexandre Nazario , Michael Lamm, Aaron Marmion \r\n\r\n<i><size=120%>Special
    Thanks:</size> </i>Skittles \r\n\r\nPlayer and enemy models Android Type 01 by
    Neko Legends \r\n\r\nPlayer and enemy animations by Mixamo\r\n\r\nBoss Sounds
    By Sfxr\n\r\nBoss Rumble sound By Freesound_Community from Pixabay\r\n\r\nplayer
    and enemies SFX:  Sfxr  And ChipTone By sfbgames \r\n\r\nMusic Westar Music and
    Free Sound"
